{
  "about": {
    "activeContributors": "Active contributors",
    "commitmentContent": "Our commitments towards the bitcoin community are the following: \n • Remain open-source \n • Provide high quality educational content \n • Translate our content in as many languages as possible \n • Support Bitcoin builders in their entrepreneurship journey",
    "commitmentTitle": "Out commitments",
    "coreTeamAjelexRole": "Node coordinator",
    "coreTeamAsioRole": "Educational coordinator",
    "coreTeamContent": "PlanB Network is a collective of hundreds of contributors, teachers, community leaders, designers, developers, and organizers. Many thanks to the numerous people who have made PlanB a reality and continue to do so each day. (Wall of contributors coming soon)",
    "coreTeamGiacomoRole": "Director and Co-founder",
    "coreTeamRogzyRole": "Product manager & Co-founder",
    "coreTeamTitle": "The core team",
    "corporateContact": "Contact information:",
    "corporateContent": "PlanB Network is the joined project of three entitites focus on Bitcoin developement. In an effort to scale the bitcoin educational layer, they decided to collaborate to form PlanB Network. To succeed in our goal to bring bitcoin education to the world, many other entites have decided to contribute and join forces. Many thanks to them",
    "corporateTitle": "Corporate behind",
    "description": "",
    "manifesto": "We believe in the decentralized future that Bitcoin offers.\n\nOur mission is to introduce Bitcoin to a billion people by a decade's time. Our tools are education and information. \n\nWe support local communities of Bitcoiners by providing open-source educational content and offering a network of Bitcoin mentors.\n\nOur philosophy is inspired by the cypherpunk manifesto. Just as they championed privacy, we champion education. We believe that knowledge is the foundation of freedom and change.\n\nWe are Bitcoin-only. \n\nWe advocate for individual responsibility and the independence offered by owning your own keys. \n\nWe urge verification, not blind trust. \n\nWe believe that by fixing the money, we fix the world.\n\nWe are decentralized and open-source, avoiding any single point of failure. \n\nWe encourage the free dissemination of our content. \n\nWe aspire to a world that operates from the bottom up, where the individual is at the center.\n\nWe simplify, we educate, we share. \n\nJoin us in our mission to orange-pill the world.\n",
    "missionContent1": "Our mission is to support local Bitcoin communities through open-source education and networking. We collect, organize, and create the necessary resources (courses, books, posters, flyers, videos) for the Bitcoin industry to advance.",
    "missionContent2": "We centralize knowledge to better distribute it through a simple, multilingual GitHub repository and an E-learning platform. We assist local Bitcoin hubs in their development with the right tools for their talent to grow.",
    "missionTitle": "Our mission",
    "storyContent": "The PlanB network is an initiative to support Bitcoin education worldwide. It's the crossover of various passionate Bitcoin companies focused on education, open-source software, peer-to-peer networks, and the sense of communities. Together, they've decided to build the PlanB network and offer the Bitcoin ecosystem the right tools to grow. Our 2023 release presentation is available here.",
    "storyTitle": "Out story",
    "title": "About the planB network"
  },
